                <pb facs="0205" n="117" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg117"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-01-25"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 25,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Conger reports that he has forwarded by mail a formal notice given him by
                    the Chinese Government that our treaty of immigration will terminate the 7th of
                    December, as provided for in article 6.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
